                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Few words about the game;\nIf you like platformers you may like it it's challenging and there really are no ''good'' new platformers out there..\nHowever game looks much better on trailer than it really is, character design and animations around him are okay, but everything else is just meh and below mediocre, you can see that time run over it since it was developed years back.\nAlso important note is that you are required to play it with controller because playing with keyboard is impossible due stupid controls.\nMusic is fun for first 5 minutes, after you realize that 30 second song keep looping it is starting to be annoying af.\nAll being written if you pay 20 bucks for this, something is seriously wrong with you. No it is not worth this money, in matter of fact it's a piss on community.\n\nOn the other hand, publisher behind this game is notorious Golden Bell Studios which have a quite history behind it.\nI'll leave it up to you if you want to spend your precious life time to google it and convince yourself even more to stay away from this game.\n\nSo initial release should be something in 2015/16 I think, and someone asked if it was today back then because it was the date announced and I replied this  : https://prnt.sc/105int6\nSee what happend ?! :D \n\nExactly! Stay the fuck away from this game, it's developer and publisher.",
